      "title": "Prospectus Summary",
      "excerpt": "PROSPECTUS SUMMARY 1 THE OFFERING 6 RISK FACTORS 8 CAUTIONARY NOTE REGARDING FORWARD-LOOKING STATEMENTS 14 USE OF PROCEEDS 16 CAPITALIZATION 17 DILUTION 19 SECURITY OWNERSHIP OF CERTAIN BENEFICIAL OWNERS AND MANAGEMENT 21 DESCRIPTION OF CAPITAL STOCK 23 DESCRIPTION OF SECURITIES WE ARE OFFERING 34 PLAN OF DISTRIBUTION 36 LEGAL MATTERS 39 EXPERTS 39 INCORPORATION OF CERTAIN INFORMATION BY REFERENCE 40 WHERE YOU CAN FIND MORE INFORMATION 41 i Table of Contents ABOUT THIS PROSPECTUS You should carefully read this prospectus before deciding to invest in our securities. We have not, and the placement agent has not, authorized anyone to provide any information or to make any representations other than those contained in, or incorporated by reference into, this prospectus, any amendment or supplement to this prospectus, or in any free writing prospectuses prepared by or on behalf of us or to wh",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Use of Proceeds",
      "excerpt": "USE OF PROCEEDS We estimate that the net proceeds from the offering will be approximately $2.52 million, assuming a public offering price of $1.10 per share of common stock (which is equal to the last reported sale price per share of our common stock on Nasdaq on October 12, 2026), and the sale of all the securities offered under this prospectus, after deducting the placement agent fees and estimated offering expenses payable by us, assuming no sale of any pre -funded warrants. However, because this is a \u201cbest efforts\u201d offering and there is no minimum offering amount required as a condition to the closing of this offering, the actual offering amount, the placement agent\u2019s fees and net proceeds to us are not presently determinable and may be substantially less than the maximum amounts set forth on the cover page of this prospectus. Additionally, to the extent we are required to make certa",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Risk Factors",
      "excerpt": "Risk factors Investing in our securities involves a high degree of risk. See \u201cRisk\u00a0Factors\u201d beginning on page 8 of this prospectus and the risk factors incorporated by reference into this prospectus. 6 Table of Contents Nasdaq listing symbol Our common stock is listed on Nasdaq under the symbol \u201cAIRE.\u201d There is no established trading market for the pre -funded warrants and we do not expect a market to develop. In addition, we do not intend to apply for the listing of the pre -funded warrants on any national securities exchange or other trading market. Without an active trading market, the liquidity of the pre -funded warrants will be limited. ____________ (1) The number of shares of common stock to be outstanding after this offering is based on 6,006,624 shares outstanding as of October 12, 2026, and excludes: \u2022 16,475 shares of common stock available for future issuance under the Compan",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    },
    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "DILUTION If you invest in our securities in this offering, your interest will be diluted immediately to the extent of the difference between the public offering price paid by the purchasers of the shares of common stock (and pre -funded warrants) sold in this offering and the as adjusted net tangible book value per shares of common stock after this offering. As of June\u00a030, 2026, our net tangible book value (deficit) was approximately $(5.91) million, or approximately $(1.10) per share of common stock. Net tangible book value per share represents our total tangible assets, less our total liabilities and mezzanine equity, divided by the number of outstanding shares of our common stock. Dilution represents the difference between the amount per share paid by purchasers in this offering and the as adjusted net tangible book value per share of common stock after the offering. After giving effe",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
